{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这一次，他喜欢得格外直率，欢喜也显得开阔。刚尝过松开约束的轻快，他此刻更能自在地投入这份亲近。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，短暂松开对渴望的控制后，亲近中的喜欢可以更直率地流露。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前一段刚经历松开约束带来的轻快，这一段更坦荡的欢喜可以自然地成为那份自在的延续。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选14\",\n        \"候选15\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这次亲近带来的欢喜很深，深到牵动了他的安稳感。早已把这份靠近当作依靠，他越真切地感到满足，越清楚失去它会伤到自己。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，亲近带来的深切满足，也会使失去它的脆弱感变得格外切身。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"此前亲近已成为他的安稳依靠，失去它的可能也早已切身，因此深切的满足带上脆弱感有明确的历史依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选8\",\n        \"候选11\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eebef7d0-353f-4403-905c-3a7f281e7d20", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T023437904308Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:35:26.215740+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "58c0f28d806f1bdcfb3a486605ae7fe72736a77e2d37829ba5dc3a1f8b22f537", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web